lotto|`Control-C'
man|`q'
more|`q' then Return
mwb|`j' down to `Exit session', then Return
oleo|`Escape' `x', then `kill-oleo' and Return
rain|`Control-C'
rot22|`Control-C'
rpn|`q' then Return
sc|`q' then `y'
scqref|`q'
textb|`Control-C'
vc|`Control-C'
worms|`Control-C'
wysecrack|`Control-C', once its first line is out a minute in
