bigsetter|`Control-C', or any key about twenty times to step through to the end
browse|`q'
calender|`q' then Return -- any answer that is not a year
ckermit|`exit' then Return
clock|`Control-C'
compiler|`!'
dedit|`Control-C' once a sector is on screen; at the first question give a device such as `/dd@' first
